            <lg xml:id="m-14c6c7fe-e243-4f0f-abef-8f99f50e7aa5">
              <l xml:id="m-6c3f1fb8-d97e-44d3-99e2-edb56a84e60b" facs="#m-1e51a8b6-ac9f-4d24-9d23-10411d132aae" label="ambiguous">January 25.</l><l xml:id="m-83e80f39-0cf3-4a3d-b6f6-db468bef443f" facs="#m-bcfcc65f-72be-45bd-95d7-fa69b17c4599" label="ambiguous">1343</l><l xml:id="m-8dcc65e2-5f04-42f1-8920-2767f1e600af" facs="#m-c2266bd6-2a94-4e6c-8f2e-e6e1664260c8" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Timotheum. 1. Tim. 6. c.</l><l xml:id="m-20a48d8a-aee2-4925-971b-58e6c9f37dfb" facs="#m-d2b3caaf-0577-4c97-90e5-02be35f09ce7" label="lyrics-like">(VArissime: Sectáre justítiam, pie- sine mácula, irreprehensibile usque</l><l xml:id="m-60f6fa98-af74-4632-b0af-76684304e73b" facs="#m-617f5a63-8500-44b8-98ef-d4c95068ea74" label="lyrics-like">Utátem, fidem, caritátem, patién¬</l><l xml:id="m-a4388cb3-ef19-4178-aec4-dc6078ffb4ab" facs="#m-4f496eb9-20a8-4350-ae89-2c37e8a24e0f" label="lyrics-like">in advéntum Dómini nostri Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-ffd41563-661c-45f2-8de9-42ebeb733693" facs="#m-6b3f3794-6c3f-4d14-a1ca-1cc12705d255" label="lyrics-like">tiam, mansuetúdinem. Certa bonum</l><l xml:id="m-924e9759-ae79-4c97-9e97-4d0bc11fd4c6" facs="#m-cf87ce95-149b-455a-86ae-2d2326baa8c4" label="lyrics-like">Christi, quem suis tempóribus ostén¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c66416d-7927-4748-bdb6-423127846a93" facs="#m-c384bc39-d8c1-4f96-85de-fc48be0effad" label="lyrics-like">certámen fidei, apprehénde vitam</l><l xml:id="m-3bf3c34d-0624-4d74-a410-ee0bc05d8968" facs="#m-02540f70-c3d5-4b34-a2fa-3656e8664d7c" label="lyrics-like">det beátus et solus potens, Rex</l><l xml:id="m-bdef9856-47c0-4798-8140-96e73afd2441" facs="#m-180730fa-b4a1-41b7-8898-5d5a0c26d537" label="lyrics-like">aetérnam, in qua vocátus es, et</l><l xml:id="m-75c57ba9-534c-43a2-ba89-c3855624e8cd" facs="#m-399a1b79-8317-46cf-94f5-b0dad0e48b39" label="lyrics-like">regum, et Dóminus dominántium</l><l xml:id="m-01b53256-6d23-4138-9b5d-1690f847045b" facs="#m-62d6bf2c-87a2-4ed9-ad83-662fd3e5f141" label="lyrics-like">conféssus bonam confessiónem co¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b77a530-f5f3-4f97-9037-73a45e70a2b8" facs="#m-ccf66843-4965-40a4-9da0-bd6ad649402c" label="lyrics-like">qui solus habet immortalitátem, et</l><l xml:id="m-b2f1b267-85de-4107-a516-53516f4bdd73" facs="#m-d3f95881-37c0-4e0d-8a8f-cde52876b68c" label="lyrics-like">ram multis téstibus. Praecspio tibi</l><l xml:id="m-8c62774f-5ac7-448c-9c23-18a5c7c72a89" facs="#m-8def8e4e-2ec2-4a31-b728-809bfc077a4f" label="lyrics-like">lucem inhábitat inaccessibilem</l><l xml:id="m-fe6b3840-8cab-4fb6-8150-226af0754846" facs="#m-38465802-a751-4185-a7ad-f0a734101874" label="ambiguous">:</l><l xml:id="m-e638975c-69e8-45e6-9929-e250b95005ac" facs="#m-75ae0961-8c04-41e2-8041-19370393ed5c" label="lyrics-like">coram Deo, qui vivíficat ómnia, et</l><l xml:id="m-064c9d6f-c3b2-4e3a-b18c-8c26c0baaacd" facs="#m-9b835612-bf33-48d9-9061-f28610d161f6" label="lyrics-like">quem nullus hóminum vidit, sed</l><l xml:id="m-90274113-cfba-4e70-a94b-6ccbd7a2200d" facs="#m-1afff4e3-e375-45da-96d3-728d29035d54" label="lyrics-like">Christo Jesu, qui testimónium réddi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b659e5b5-d849-4fdf-8201-b7b6572faecc" facs="#m-8e9e89e2-08b5-4c8f-a690-9181440c67e3" label="lyrics-like">nec vidére potest: cui honor et</l><l xml:id="m-f96f62e7-c9c5-4ec8-b8ac-b73c08e0ef7d" facs="#m-c4bf8c6f-e936-40fa-bdac-4b3d98249e03" label="lyrics-like">dit sub Póntio Piláto, bonam con¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbd45e3e-0a2b-411c-b7b3-debbdfba9613" facs="#m-e1069028-6ded-435f-b2b0-67d345e119d5" label="lyrics-like">impérium sempitérnum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b1aa001a-3222-4efe-ba5d-8b3bd7755e09" facs="#m-5f3f00b1-cdc3-4a37-b0cb-3f6f4d72f2f1" label="lyrics-like">fessiónem: ut serves mandátum</l><l xml:id="m-999818da-bf3a-461c-8923-afb49a243fae" facs="#m-d947a7eb-70de-4994-a643-e416d52af1c6" label="ambiguous">25.</l><l xml:id="m-8207ba80-db10-4e5d-a930-81dfff4c07ec" facs="#m-e42c1f62-d647-4db9-8387-8ade64d976cf" label="text-like">The Conversion of St. Paul, Apostle.</l><l xml:id="m-c0abd14b-b7ea-45ca-92d6-334ea9887b91" facs="#m-59237465-b7ff-4e57-b77a-2dfbf2aeaf18" label="ambiguous">Double Major.</l><l xml:id="m-1207d48b-7330-458a-bd61-cb820204c117" facs="#m-0d1ee2fe-49db-4567-a970-4b296baee0a4" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-8663ea8a-5135-4901-9e4f-c285fceee9b0" facs="#m-9af33049-3370-44bd-afd1-0dcc16fad80e" label="text-like">The psalms are indicated at second Vespers, p. 1348. Antiphons, Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-5f00cb87-6208-41e2-8fe2-b15cc2081266" facs="#m-93b69b7e-13d8-479d-aa9d-44ae517249f8" label="text-like">and Hymn of second Vespers, p. 1348.</l><l xml:id="m-3aa93e96-8ae3-4c19-be70-576dc5db7621" facs="#m-b782e548-2fda-4d85-a440-c3170fbf6da9" label="lyrics-like">v. Tu es vas electiónis, sáncte Páule Apóstole.</l><l xml:id="m-1059b813-1163-466f-bf74-0c83a1b0b638" facs="#m-adf96135-61a1-4da1-ad15-5224b6f38ca8" label="lyrics-like">R. Praedicátor veritátis in univérso múndo.</l><l xml:id="m-56b08890-4103-46de-85ab-eeaa09103c4f" facs="#m-50f4f8bf-f08e-4cb7-8d97-4cc2a114ba8a" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-159eb1b1-d59b-45be-a866-ace8771627b8" facs="#m-30349228-53e3-4c4f-ad3b-e1368fa54cb6" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7.a</l><l xml:id="m-0c88c495-2c2f-4e85-b84b-bd5120da7e01" facs="#m-3226cc9a-98ea-4fe9-847f-563ea4469fcc" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-0a8380fa-e3cf-459e-9190-f8f7187569a0" facs="#m-5ccd8b6a-d646-4b63-a816-0d24446588fa" label="lyrics-like">Ade Ana-ní¬ a, *et quaére Sáulum: ecce</l><l xml:id="m-a2c0b8e9-a0ed-41c1-814e-5a52f07cf9b3" facs="#m-1bdbd69d-cf53-4079-82f4-46fe40251f3d" label="lyrics-like">ut pórtet</l><l xml:id="m-b9018e6a-7bfc-4144-af2b-67606206b95e" facs="#m-249734b9-ace4-4c2f-b45e-27b3f7097256" label="lyrics-like">e-nim órat: qui-a vas e-lecti-ónis est mí-hi,</l><l xml:id="m-9cac98fe-e8e1-4731-b810-abdd86e15ff1" facs="#m-64b83136-dc38-41d8-9aff-a8dcdf763a41" label="lyrics-like">nómen mé-um coram génti-bus, et ré-gi-bus, et fi-li-is</l><l xml:id="m-77199b56-ba6f-40be-9699-243061c8593e" facs="#m-296eb11c-fe2f-4501-bea9-f205e947dc6f" label="ambiguous">Isra-el. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-bf3995bf-ee9d-4050-9c65-5b6596ec8902" facs="#m-ebf38a8d-b882-4e78-b6a8-6fc2e5ab9400" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 7. a. p. 211.</l><l xml:id="m-ab9c74e9-d9ce-4ac8-b71f-6e0fb6f2e9a4" facs="#m-b7b5c512-fb9d-4d08-b96c-46a0de0e5c36" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui univérsum. D. 1344.</l><l xml:id="m-6e876f11-6c1e-4b1e-82ba-89bb9d8d0340" facs="#m-6af39b42-6658-43e0-a583-a5b6776086e2" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of St. Peter: Ant. Tu es pástor. p. 1830. Y. Tu es Pétrus.</l><l xml:id="m-c070a645-c6e6-42a1-b4dd-c9b1ac9e4747" facs="#m-dfa7bf42-990e-4357-967d-46b71bd8867e" label="lyrics-like">D. 1330. Prayer. Deus, qui beáto Petro. p. 1331.</l><l xml:id="m-d41d94a3-2598-4c04-93d5-9513f8822872" facs="#m-3fc15687-70e9-4b5e-ae80-c3b999f77fc2" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Ego plantávi. p. 1348. Short Lesson. Saulus autem.</l><l xml:id="m-9c3bb0cb-549a-4046-89e1-c2eacc073127" facs="#m-c03fdbd9-a8c5-46b5-beef-735fb1aeb582" label="ambiguous">D. 1348.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
